{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "legal-practice-monitoring-api",
		"name": "Legal Practice Management - Monitoring API",
		"description": "Dedicated Postman collection for testing the Legal Practice Management system monitoring endpoints. This collection provides comprehensive system observability and health monitoring capabilities.\n\n## 🔐 Authentication Required\nAll monitoring endpoints require **Admin Lawyer** permissions with JWT authentication.\n\n## Getting Started\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Import the environment file: `Legal_Practice_Management.postman_environment.json`\n3. Login as an admin user to get JWT tokens\n4. Use the monitoring endpoints to track system health\n\n## 📊 Monitoring Capabilities\n- **System Dashboard**: Overall statistics and metrics\n- **Log Analysis**: Multi-level logging with filtering\n- **User Activity**: Detailed user behavior tracking\n- **Health Monitoring**: System alerts and performance metrics\n- **Security Monitoring**: Authentication logs and audit trails\n\n## 🎯 Use Cases\n- System administration and maintenance\n- Performance monitoring and optimization\n- Security incident investigation\n- User behavior analysis\n- Troubleshooting and debugging\n- Compliance and audit reporting\n\n## 📝 Log Types Available\n- **General**: System-wide information logs\n- **Error**: Error logs and exceptions\n- **Performance**: Request timing and slow queries\n- **API**: API request logs with user context\n- **Authentication**: Login attempts and security events\n- **Audit**: Data modification trails and user actions",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🚀 Setup & Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Admin Login (Required First)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Automatically set tokens if login successful",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", jsonData.access);",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"refresh_token\", jsonData.refresh);",
									"    console.log(\"✅ Tokens set successfully\");",
									"    console.log(\"User:\", jsonData.user.email, \"Role:\", jsonData.user.role);",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log(\"❌ Login failed\");",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"sarah.wilson@lawfirm.com\",\n    \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login/",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"login",
								""
							]
						},
						"description": "Login as admin user to get JWT tokens required for monitoring endpoints. Tokens are automatically saved to environment variables."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Verify Admin Access",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Admin access verified\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.role).to.eql(\"admin\");",
									"    console.log(\"✅ Admin access confirmed for:\", jsonData.email);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
								"description": "JWT access token"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/current-user/",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"current-user",
								""
							]
						},
						"description": "Verify that you have admin access before using monitoring endpoints."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Authentication setup required for monitoring endpoints. All monitoring APIs require admin lawyer permissions."
		},
